  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating the Reintegration Achievements of Senegalese Returned Migrants through Integrated Support to Micro and Small Enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at increasing economic opportunities for returnees in Senegal, including those living in rural and semi-urban areas, to boost youth employability, including through the support of the diaspora. The project also provides 6 month-long entrepreneurship trainings to 220 returned migrants and youth in the region. At the same time, the project addresses the youth and their family members in the community remote villages and schools aiming at changing the narrative&apos;s focus from the dangers of irregular migration to promote national opportunities and positive models of success of returnees and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
